concept:c2020a00070-sch-2-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Subsection 15YM(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) A video recording of an interview of a person to whom subsection (1A) applies in a proceeding may be admitted as evidence in chief if a constable, or a person of a kind specified in the regulations, conducted the interview." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) A video recording of an interview of a person to whom subsection (1A) applies in a proceeding may be admitted as evidence in chief if a constable, or a person of a kind specified in the regulations, conducted the interview."@en ;
