concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Paragraph 272.10(1)(b) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (b) one or more of the following apply:  (i) the child has a mental impairment at the time the person commits the underlying offence;  (ii) the person is in a position of trust or authority in relation to the child, or the child is otherwise under the care, supervision or authority of the person, at the time the person commits the underlying offence;  Schedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (b) one or more of the following apply:  (i) the child has a mental impairment at the time the person commits the underlying offence;  (ii) the person is in a position of trust or authority in relation to the child, or the child is otherwise under the care, supervision or authority of the person, at the time the person commits the underlying offence;  Schedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences"@en ;
