concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 After subsection 471.27(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  Strengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020  (1A) For the purposes of an offence against section 471.25A, absolute liability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the offence that the child is someone who is under 16. Note 1: For absolute liability, see section 6.2. Note 2: For a defence based on belief about age, see section 471.29." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  Strengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020  (1A) For the purposes of an offence against section 471.25A, absolute liability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the offence that the child is someone who is under 16. Note 1: For absolute liability, see section 6.2. Note 2: For a defence based on belief about age, see section 471.29."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ab8536141c23812fa5aa5003d58fc495243948108b1a6f31042ff8ba160582af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Absolute liability applies for an offence against section 471.25A when the child is under 16." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
