concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 After subsection 471.29(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1A) It is a defence to a prosecution for an offence against section 471.25A if the defendant proves that, at the time he or she caused the article to be carried, the defendant believed that the child was at least 16. Note: A defendant bears a legal burden in relation to the matter in this subsection, see section 13.4." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1A) It is a defence to a prosecution for an offence against section 471.25A if the defendant proves that, at the time he or she caused the article to be carried, the defendant believed that the child was at least 16. Note: A defendant bears a legal burden in relation to the matter in this subsection, see section 13.4."@en ;
