concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(4) 23A  Conduct for the purposes of electronic service used for"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-474-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this Code: electronic service means a service a purpose of which is to:  (a) allow persons to access material using a carriage service; or  (b) deliver material to persons having equipment appropriate for receiving that material, where the delivery of the service is by means of a carriage service; but does not include:  Schedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences" ;
    skos:definition "(4) In this Code: electronic service means a service a purpose of which is to:  (a) allow persons to access material using a carriage service; or  (b) deliver material to persons having equipment appropriate for receiving that material, where the delivery of the service is by means of a carriage service; but does not include:  Schedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fba21be21f0572fe2510d6758084c714c51e3d477ca883b4f235cb5ae244fab" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474 ;
