concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-25 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25 Subsection 474.25A(1) of the Criminal Code (before the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-25 ;
    values:originalText "penalty) Insert: Note: Because of the definition of engage in sexual activity in the Dictionary, this offence covers (for example): (a) a person using a carriage service to see or hear, in real time, a person under 16 engage in sexual activity; and (b) a person engaging in sexual activity that is seen or heard, in real time, by a person under 16 using a carriage service." ;
    skos:definition "penalty) Insert: Note: Because of the definition of engage in sexual activity in the Dictionary, this offence covers (for example): (a) a person using a carriage service to see or hear, in real time, a person under 16 engage in sexual activity; and (b) a person engaging in sexual activity that is seen or heard, in real time, by a person under 16 using a carriage service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c86588316c66fa6404f244547d72b8eaf1a4320c3191222a54af5d7650878a56" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibits using a carriage service to see or hear a person under 16 engage in sexual activity." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2020a00070.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2020a00070.pdf, p.22" ;
