concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-26 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26 Subsection 474.25A(2) of the Criminal Code (before the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-26 ;
    values:originalText "penalty) Insert: Note: Because of the definition of engage in sexual activity in the Dictionary, this offence covers (for example) causing a person under 16: (a) to engage in sexual activity that is seen or heard, in real time, by another person using a carriage service; or (b) to use a carriage service to see or hear, in real time, another person engage in sexual activity." ;
    skos:definition "penalty) Insert: Note: Because of the definition of engage in sexual activity in the Dictionary, this offence covers (for example) causing a person under 16: (a) to engage in sexual activity that is seen or heard, in real time, by another person using a carriage service; or (b) to use a carriage service to see or hear, in real time, another person engage in sexual activity."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ef9c35f4d868180b7f51fd3e899f6af6694e801e041c22124a67876aa1f30495" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibits causing a person under 16 to engage in sexual activity that is seen or heard by another person using a carriage service." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
