concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474 27A, evidence that a person was represented to the defendant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-474-5 ;
    values:originalText "as being under, of, at least or over a particular age is, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, proof that the defendant believed the person to be under, of, at least or over that age (as the case requires).  Strengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "as being under, of, at least or over a particular age is, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, proof that the defendant believed the person to be under, of, at least or over that age (as the case requires).  Strengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "016d8abfee20eb5346bf7e98afa594e22f4e201c937ea63c6817c971a4260948" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Belief of defendant's age is proof in absence of evidence to the contrary." ;
