doc:sch-4-sec-474-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "474 27A, evidence that a person was represented to the defendant" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "as being under, of, at least or over a particular age is, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, proof that the defendant believed the person to be under, of, at least or over that age (as the case requires).  Strengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer .

