concept:c2020a00070-sch-8-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Application provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-8-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to determining, on or after the commencement of this Schedule, a sentence to be passed, or an order to be made, in respect of a person for a federal offence that the person was charged with, or convicted of, on or after that commencement.  Additional sentencing factors for certain offences  Schedule 9  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to determining, on or after the commencement of this Schedule, a sentence to be passed, or an order to be made, in respect of a person for a federal offence that the person was charged with, or convicted of, on or after that commencement.  Additional sentencing factors for certain offences  Schedule 9  No. 70, 2020 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2846bf3cf048ceff2be6f04a2f57102b9b1469e536372867ef8ba934a72ce07a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer ;
