    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) a person who is serving or is to serve a federal sentence or federal sentences is released on parole or licence under this Act; and  (b) the person is later sentenced (the new sentence or sentences) to a term of imprisonment in respect of one or more federal, State or Territory offences committed during the parole period or licence period; and  (ba) under section 19AQ:  (i) the parole order or licence is to be taken to have been revoked; and  (ii) the person becomes liable to serve a part of a sentence or sentences (the outstanding sentence or sentences);  Schedule 13  Revocation of parole order or licence  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020 No. 70, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) a person who is serving or is to serve a federal sentence or federal sentences is released on parole or licence under this Act; and  (b) the person is later sentenced (the new sentence or sentences) to a term of imprisonment in respect of one or more federal, State or Territory offences committed during the parole period or licence period; and  (ba) under section 19AQ:  (i) the parole order or licence is to be taken to have been revoked; and  (ii) the person becomes liable to serve a part of a sentence or sentences (the outstanding sentence or sentences);  Schedule 13  Revocation of parole order or licence  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and Community Protection Measures) Act 2020 No. 70, 2020"@en ;
